Runs the caps and boot checks, and prints the build, test, lint, and workspace commands

Usage: leptoskit budgets [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
